  "name": "The Archangel",
  "type": "subclass",
  "img": "modules/grimnir-lyonesse/assets/icons/lorc-angel-wings.svg",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Warlock Patron: The Archangel You have sworn yourself to the Archangel, a radiant incarnation of the Seven Heavens. Where the balance of the mortal world fractures beneath corruption or unbound chaos, the Archangel descends through chosen vessels to strike without mercy. Its light does not comfort. It condemns. In dreams, you walk the endless steps of heaven as a towering, faceless figure wreathed in blinding radiance watches in silence. You feel its purpose more than hear its voice. Destroy what must not endure. End what has escaped judgment. Whether you accepted this pact in devotion or defiance matters little. The Archangel does not bargain. It appoints. You are now its instrument, bearing a fragment of heaven’s wrath into a world that has long deserved it.</p>"
    },
    "source": {
      "custom": "Legends of the Round Table: Chivalric Handbook",
      "page": "62",
      "rules": "2024"
    },
